#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/esp-usb-bridge.rst:20
msgid ""
"The ESP USB Bridge is an ESP-IDF project utilizing an ESP32-S2 (or "
"optionally, an ESP32-S3) chip to create a bridge between a computer (PC) and "
"a target microcontroller (MCU). It can serve as a replacement for USB-to-"
"UART chips (e.g. CP210x). Official reference can be found `here <https://"
"github.com/espressif/esp-usb-bridge?"
"utm_source=platformio&utm_medium=docs>`__."
msgstr ""

